    "Unknown Check resends the same position request with current credentials. Every successful acknowledgment, including cached historical receipt, is followed by canonical issue/order reads. Historical acknowledgment payload is never installed as the current issue; newer local versions are fenced.",
    "Known stale-source/order conflicts fetch current canonical facts for explicit review and a new request key. Maintenance applied:false retains intent and never automoves. Source/private denial removes facts; a missing job reauthorizes its canonical team before treating the team as lost.",
    "Progress displays real staged/applied/total counts, with unknown total explicit. Normal polling is2000ms. Resume uses current server can_resume and a fresh canonical job ETag; no frontend manager inference or automatic resume replay.",
