    "Position activity is intelligible after the existing safe event projection strips raw position fields; status facts and grouping barriers remain intact, without rank/neighbor facts.",
    "IssueList native query maxlength200 is removed within this vertical; full256-scalar forwarding is tested and Rust remains authoritative. No other cap wave is included."
